\newlabel{tab:freeform_signals}{{5}{7}{Signal comparison under free-form decoding (SciERC NER, Qwen3-8B, $n = 476$). Log-prob reverses from worst (constrained, Table~\ref {tab:qe_scierc}) to best. Structural signals remain stable}{table.caption.27}{}}
